### Description
This Terraform program creates a basic AWS CodeBuild project with an associated IAM role. The IAM role is configured with the necessary permissions for CodeBuild operations. The CodeBuild project is set up to use a GitHub source, although the specific GitHub source configuration is not included in this basic setup.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "codebuild_role" {
  name = "codebuild-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action = "sts:AssumeRole"
        Effect = "Allow"
        Principal = {
          Service = "codebuild.amazonaws.com"
        }
      }
    ]
  })

  inline_policy {
    name = "codebuild-policy"
    policy = jsonencode({
      Version = "2012-10-17"
      Statement = [
        {
          Action = [
            "logs:CreateLogGroup",
            "logs:CreateLogStream",
            "logs:PutLogEvents"
          ]
          Effect = "Allow"
          Resource = "*"
        },
        {
          Action = [
            "s3:GetObject",
            "s3:PutObject"
          ]
          Effect = "Allow"
          Resource = "arn:aws:s3:::your-bucket-name/*"
        }
      ]
    })
  }
}

resource "aws_codebuild_project" "basic_codebuild_project" {
  name         = "basic-codebuild-project"
  service_role = aws_iam_role.codebuild_role.arn

  source {
    type            = "GITHUB"
    location        = "https://github.com/your-repo-owner/your-repo-name.git"
    auth            = "OAUTH"
    buildspec       = "buildspec.yml"
    git_clone_depth = 1
  }

  environment {
    compute_type = "BUILD_GENERAL1_SMALL"
    image        = "aws/codebuild/amazonlinux2-x86_64-standard:3.0"
    type         = "LINUX_CONTAINER"
  }

  artifacts {
    type = "NO_ARTIFACTS"
  }
}
```

### Explanation
1. **Provider Configuration**: The AWS provider is configured to use the `us-west-2` region.
2. **IAM Role**: An IAM role named `codebuild-role` is created with an assume role policy that allows CodeBuild to assume the role. An inline policy is added to grant necessary permissions for logging and S3 access.
3. **CodeBuild Project**: A CodeBuild project named `basic-codebuild-project` is created. It uses the IAM role created earlier. The source is configured to use a GitHub repository, and the environment is set up with a small Linux container. No artifacts are specified for simplicity.

Make sure to replace `"your-bucket-name"` and `"https://github.com/your-repo-owner/your-repo-name.git"` with your actual S3 bucket name and GitHub repository URL.

