This Terraform program sets up a primary Redshift cluster in `us-east-1` and a secondary Redshift cluster in `us-east-2`. The secondary cluster is configured to replicate data from the primary cluster. The program includes the necessary IAM roles and policies to manage access between the clusters.

### Terraform HCL Program

