### Description

This Terraform program sets up a PostgreSQL 15 instance on AWS RDS within specific public subnets for running Airbyte connector test cases. The database is configured with managed settings for low maintenance, skips the final snapshot upon deletion, and applies changes immediately. The program includes the necessary provider configuration and IAM roles.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

variable "db_subnet_group_name" {
  description = "The name of the DB subnet group"
  default     = "airbyte-subnet-group"
}

variable "db_instance_class" {
  description = "The instance class for the RDS instance"
  default     = "db.t3.micro"
}

variable "allocated_storage" {
  description = "The allocated storage for the RDS instance"
  default     = 20
}

variable "db_name" {
  description = "The name of the database"
  default     = "airbyte_db"
}

variable "db_username" {
  description = "The username for the database"
  default     = "airbyte_user"
}

variable "db_password" {
  description = "The password for the database"
  default     = "securepassword123"
}

resource "aws_db_subnet_group" "airbyte_subnet_group" {
  name       = var.db_subnet_group_name
  subnet_ids = ["subnet-0123456789abcdef0", "subnet-0fedcba9876543210"]

  tags = {
    Name = "AirbyteSubnetGroup"
  }
}

resource "aws_db_instance" "airbyte_postgres_instance" {
  identifier              = "airbyte-postgres-instance"
  instance_class          = var.db_instance_class
  allocated_storage       = var.allocated_storage
  engine                  = "postgres"
  engine_version          = "15"
  db_name                 = var.db_name
  username                = var.db_username
  password                = var.db_password
  db_subnet_group_name    = aws_db_subnet_group.airbyte_subnet_group.name
  skip_final_snapshot     = true
  apply_immediately       = true
  publicly_accessible     = true
  vpc_security_group_ids  = ["sg-0123456789abcdef0"]
  parameter_group_name    = "default.postgres15"

  timeouts {
    create = "30m"
    update = "30m"
    delete = "30m"
  }

  depends_on = [
    aws_db_subnet_group.airbyte_subnet_group
  ]
}
```

### Explanation

1. **Provider Configuration**: The AWS provider is configured to use the `us-west-2` region.
2. **Variables**: Several variables are defined with default values to customize the RDS instance settings.
3. **DB Subnet Group**: An `aws_db_subnet_group` resource is created to specify the subnets where the RDS instance will be deployed.
4. **RDS Instance**: An `aws_db_instance` resource is created with the specified parameters, including the instance class, allocated storage, engine, engine version, database name, username, and password. The instance is configured to skip the final snapshot upon deletion and apply changes immediately. It is also made publicly accessible for testing purposes, and a security group is associated with it.

This configuration ensures that the PostgreSQL 15 instance is set up with the required settings for running Airbyte connector test cases.

