### Description
This Terraform program creates an S3 Glacier vault and configures AWS Data Lifecycle Manager (DLM) to transition data to this Glacier vault. It includes the necessary IAM role and policy to allow DLM to interact with Glacier.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"
}

resource "aws_glacier_vault" "my_glacier_vault" {
  name = "my-glacier-vault"
  tags = {
    Name = "My Glacier Vault"
  }
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "dlm_glacier_role" {
  name = "dlm-glacier-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action = "sts:AssumeRole"
        Effect = "Allow"
        Principal = {
          Service = "dlm.amazonaws.com"
        }
      }
    ]
  })
}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy" "dlm_glacier_policy" {
  name = "dlm-glacier-policy"
  role = aws_iam_role.dlm_glacier_role.id

  policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action = [
          "glacier:InitiateJob",
          "glacier:GetJobOutput",
          "glacier:ListJobs",
          "glacier:DescribeVault",
          "glacier:UploadArchive",
          "glacier:DeleteArchive"
        ]
        Effect = "Allow"
        Resource = aws_glacier_vault.my_glacier_vault.arn
      }
    ]
  })
}

resource "aws_dlm_lifecycle_policy" "dlm_glacier_policy" {
  description          = "Transition data to Glacier"
  execution_role_arn   = aws_iam_role.dlm_glacier_role.arn

  policy_details {
    policy_type = "EBS_SNAPSHOT_MANAGEMENT"

    resource_types = ["VOLUME"]

    schedule {
      name     = "weekly-snapshot"
      copy_tags = true
      create_rule {
        interval      = 7
        interval_unit = "DAY"
        times         = ["23:00"]
      }
      retain_rule {
        count = 12
      }
    }

    target_tags = {
      Name = "MyVolume"
    }
  }
}
```

### Explanation
1. **Provider Configuration**: The AWS provider is configured to use the `us-west-2` region.
2. **Glacier Vault**: An S3 Glacier vault named `my-glacier-vault` is created.
3. **IAM Role**: An IAM role named `dlm-glacier-role` is created with a trust policy that allows DLM to assume the role.
4. **IAM Role Policy**: An IAM policy named `dlm-glacier-policy` is attached to the IAM role, granting permissions for DLM to interact with the Glacier vault.
5. **DLM Lifecycle Policy**: A DLM lifecycle policy is created to transition EBS snapshots to the Glacier vault. The policy specifies a weekly snapshot schedule and retains 12 snapshots.

